    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010920/extras/f722f69b1de1bb64798c920e2bfe05ae.avif?t=1754562097\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fortress Fury is a multiplayer tower defense  game with minimalistic gameplay and roguelite elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The monsters are here, and there's no place to run or hide. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defeat the enemies!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All you can do is survive as long as you can until other towers are fallen. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather gold  to buy upgrades and win other players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Builds</strong>: With over 16 different weapons  to choose from throughout a run, no two attempts will ever be the same</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rank System</strong>: Compete your skills with other players in session and overall</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Cast &amp; Tower Arsenal</strong>: Experiment with builds across a wide cast of unlockable towers and upgradable weapons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pick Up And Play</strong>: Approachable 10-20 minute runs built with quick play sessions in mind</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3010920/extras/f722f69b1de1bb64798c920e2bfe05ae.avif?t=1754562097\" width=600 height=200 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fortress Fury is a multiplayer tower defense  game with minimalistic gameplay and roguelite elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The monsters are here, and there's no place to run or hide. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defeat the enemies!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All you can do is survive as long as you can until other towers are fallen. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather gold  to buy upgrades and win other players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Builds</strong>: With over 16 different weapons  to choose from throughout a run, no two attempts will ever be the same</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Rank System</strong>: Compete your skills with other players in session and overall</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Cast &amp; Tower Arsenal</strong>: Experiment with builds across a wide cast of unlockable towers and upgradable weapons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pick Up And Play</strong>: Approachable 10-20 minute runs built with quick play sessions in mind</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
